  "name": "pitmry-canonical-retrieval-golden",
  "notes": "Canonical-store rewrite of the legacy Cavemem golden set. Every expected_any ID is a canonical .pitmry record id (dec_/git_/sum_ + hex24) verified against live retrieval before recording. Legacy adr-N/commit-N ids were removed because the Phase 2 migration was deliberately scoped to the PITMRY labels (dec_f335ff01180454f98f9367a2). Thresholds are regression floors set below observed values, not targets.",
